CODEGEN.md §2.11, §3.5, DECISIONS 435: a go emit may cut decode<T> into decode<T>_<N> parts; a record renamed Item_1 (an exported override may hold an underscore) has the decoder decodeItem_1, which Item's part 1 would redeclare, whatever Item's width.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A decoded record.
record Item {
  /// Its size.
  n: Int
}

/// Renamed like a part of decodeItem.
record ItemOne @go(name: "Item_1") {
  /// Its size.
  n: Int
}

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a", mode: types }
